ess of the scheduled trigger rests on inspection of the crontab entry plus manual invocations of the same script rather than an observed autonomous nightly run.","Source data at /srv/inventory/data on node2 did not pre-exist and was created by the executor as sample data; the backup mechanism was validated against this synthetic dataset rather than pre-existing production data."]},"ttft_ms":33856,"type":"result","duration_ms":81817,"uuid":"26581976-4640-47e3-afc8-dacd2bc64e9d","ttft_stream_ms":2336,"time_to_request_ms":51,"first_content_frame_ms":2336,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
